# Fractal Tender entering with a +1/+1 counter counts as a counter put on it this turn (CR 122.6): with Gev, Scaled Scorch out
# (other creatures Bot1 controls enter with an additional counter for each opponent who lost life this turn) and Bot2 bolted
# earlier in turn 3, the Tender arrives with one counter, so at the end step Bot1 gets a Fractal with three counters, and Gev
# gives that token its own additional counter: four.

